sequenceDiagram
    actor S as Student
    participant W as Web app
    participant MS as Match service
    participant D as Database

    S->>W: Open Find a Match, set filters
    W->>MS: searchMatches(sport, day, time range, skill level)
    MS->>D: Read open matches that satisfy all filters
    D-->>MS: matches ordered by start time
    MS-->>W: Match list
    W-->>S: Show list (empty list suggests Create Match)
    S->>W: Open a match and select Join
    W->>MS: joinMatch(matchId, userId)
    MS->>D: Lock match row, read participants
    alt Match is full
        MS-->>W: This match is full
    else Student already joined
        MS-->>W: You have already joined this match
    else Free place
        MS->>D: Insert MATCH_PARTICIPANT
        opt Capacity reached
            MS->>D: Set status full
        end
        MS-->>W: Joined
        W-->>S: Confirmation
    end
